{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03342","headline":"奉和幸神皐亭应制 · 宋之问","name":"奉和幸神皐亭应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清跸喧黄道，乘舆降紫宸。\n霜戈凝晓日，云管发阳春。\n台古全疑汉，林余半识秦。\n宴酣诗布泽，节改令行仁。\n昔恃山河险，今依道德淳。\n多慙献嘉颂，空累属车尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}